<title>UK: London gold fixed at lowest since September 1993.</title>
<headline>London gold fixed at lowest since September 1993.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold was fixed at $350.10 an ounce on Wednesday morning, the lowest fixing since September 15, 1993.</p>
<p>It had previously fixed at $354.70 on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
